  "acceptance_includes": [
    "Two independent processes exchange exact original revision bytes between distinct databases",
    "Local revision and outbox share one commit; remote receive never enqueues",
    "Same ID and same bytes is idempotent, including after ack; different bytes collide",
    "Ack checks SHA and retains immutable history; retry retains original bytes and fixed status token",
    "Concurrent heads and tombstones remain without clock selection or implicit resurrection",
    "Reverse parent arrival, missing or foreign parents and explicit restore rules",
    "Cycle closure and transaction fault rollback",
    "Real process kills before outbox insertion and after successful commit with fresh-process recovery",
    "Strict bounded JSON, duplicate keys, UTF-8, schema fields and explicit location-mode rejection",
    "4096-revision deep chain uses iterative graph traversal; 4097th insert rolls back"
